  "remarks": "JSC Econombank is a major regional Russian bank headquarted in the \nSaratov region. It is ranked among the top 50 Russian banks with a record \nincrease in assets. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial \nrevenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC \nEconombank is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial \nsource of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is \nresponsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
